OL,3,GNEWSAGirl finds 14,000 namesakes for
OL,4,Acharity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA schoolgirl undergoing treatment for a
OL,7,Fbrain tumour has raised more than
OL,8,F#100,000 for charity by finding 14,000
OL,9,Fpeople who share her name.
OL,11,FKirsty, 12, from Tunbridge Wells,
OL,12,Flaunched the campaign after being
OL,13,Fdiagnosed with a brain tumour in
OL,14,FNovember 2024 when she began losing her
OL,15,Feyesight and memory.
OL,17,FHer search has connected fellow
OL,18,FKirsties in 50 countries and helped
OL,19,Fraise money for Oscar's Paediatric
OL,20,FBrain Tumour Charity.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
